X-Wing recomp

The host is derived from the Crazy Taxi recomp
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/crazytaxi-recomp), and softdd.c from the
Beavis and Butt-head in Virtual Stupidity recomp; both run on pcrecomp's
native32 runtime (https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp), all MIT.

